I found 10 problems on `2026-10-05-tool-config-templates`. The most serious is that the packs' dependency-install subtasks and several format and lint subtasks were deleted instead of moved. I had no access to the U6 and U7 (pending) docs, so I did not count stale task names in prose as findings.

